      "id": "draw-rectangle-c9ac8c",
      "name": "DrawRectangle",
      "category": "DrawRectangle",
      "signature": "DrawRectangle(RHI Cmd List, Vertex Shader, X, Y, Size X, Size Y, U, V, Size U, Size V, Target Size, Texture Size, Flags, Instance Count)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "RHI Cmd List",
          "type": "FRHICommandList&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Vertex Shader",
          "type": "TShaderRef<FShader>&"
        },
        {
          "name": "X",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "Y",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "Size X",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "Size Y",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "U",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "V",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "Size U",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "Size V",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "Target Size",
          "type": "FIntPoint"
        },
        {
          "name": "Texture Size",
          "type": "FIntPoint"
        },
        {
          "name": "Flags",
          "type": "EDrawRectangleFlags",
          "default": "EDRF_Default"
        },
        {
          "name": "Instance Count",
          "type": "UInt",
          "default": "1"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Draws a quad with the given vertex positions and UVs in denormalized pixel/texel coordinates.\nThe platform-dependent mapping from pixels to texels is done automatically.\nNote that the positions are affected by the current viewport.\nNOTE: DrawRectangle should be used in the vertex shader to calculate the correct position and uv for vertices.\nNOTE2: Assumes previously set PSO has PrimitiveType = PT_TriangleList\nX, Y\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosition in screen pixels of the top left corner of the quad\nSizeX, SizeY\t\t\t\t\tSize in screen pixels of the quad\nU, V\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosition in texels of the top left corner of the quad's UV's\nSizeU, SizeV\t\t\t\t\tSize in texels of the quad's UV's\nTargetSizeX, TargetSizeY\t\tSize in screen pixels of the target surface\nTextureSize                  Size in texels of the source texture\nVertexShader\t\t\t\t\tThe vertex shader used for rendering\nFlags\t\t\t\t\t\tsee EDrawRectangleFlags\nInstanceCount\t\t\t\tNumber of instances of rectangle"
    },
